Benarkah? Sungguh?

36
00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.140
Selamanya dan selamanya?

37
00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.640
Ya. Selamanya.

38
00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:57.720
