848
00:45:18.600 --> 00:45:19.890
Cukup sudah.

849
00:45:19.970 --> 00:45:21.366
- Kita buat dia bicara.
- Biar aku saja, Woody.

850
00:45:21.390 --> 00:45:22.390
Hei! Hei!

851
00:45:22.470 --> 00:45:23.826
