1574
01:25:18.810 --> 01:25:20.269
<i>- Ayo coba pecahkan...</i>
<i>- </i>Hai, Bonnie.

1575
01:25:20.270 --> 01:25:22.870
- <i>rekor tertinggi kita.</i>
- Aku membawa boneka-bonekamu.

1576
01:25:24.020 --> 01:25:25.809
Bonnie, ayo sapa.

1577
01:25:25.810 --> 01:25:27.450
Oke.

1578
01:25:35.430 --> 01:25:37.070
Hai.

1579
01:25:37.310 --> 01:25:38.910
Hai.

1580
01:25:46.060 --> 01:25:48.019
Maaf. Aku sudah nggak
bermain dengan boneka...

1581
01:25:48.020 --> 01:25:50.280
Kemarin aku sempat bermain dengannya.

1582
01:25:50.520 --> 01:25:52.139
Aku suka kalau dia bilang,

1583
01:25:52.140 --> 01:25:54.660
"Aku nggak takut apa pun, partner."

1584
01:26:00.770 --> 01:26:03.309
Itu... agak aneh.

1585
01:26:03.310 --> 01:26:05.450
Uh... Aku...

1586
01:26:05.520 --> 01:26:07.200
Maaf sudah mengganggumu.

1587
01:26:11.600 --> 01:26:13.139
- Oh, jangan pergi.
- Jangan, jangan, jangan.

1588
01:26:13.140 --> 01:26:15.580
- Dia nggak boleh pergi. Jangan!
- Jangan, jangan, jangan.

1589
01:26:16.600 --> 01:26:18.240
Blaze!

1590
01:26:31.180 --> 01:26:34.910
Aku suka sepatu botmu.

1591
01:26:37.890 --> 01:26:40.740
Aku... aku suka kaus kakimu.

1592
01:26:42.850 --> 01:26:46.240
Kamu suka janggutku, Nona?

1593
01:26:46.350 --> 01:26:49.059
Sangat mengesankan, Nona.

1594
01:26:49.060 --> 01:26:51.769
Ya, umurku satu miliar tahun.

1595
01:26:51.770 --> 01:26:54.870
Makanya janggutku begitu gagah.

1596
01:27:01.470 --> 01:27:02.809
Um...

1597
01:27:02.810 --> 01:27:04.890
Kamu mau bermain?

1598
01:27:06.810 --> 01:27:08.310
Oke.

1599
01:27:08.890 --> 01:27:10.309
Walter, ayo.
Oke. Oke.

1600
01:27:10.310 --> 01:27:12.179
- Kamu benar-benar punya kuda?
- Ya.

1601
01:27:12.180 --> 01:27:13.679
Maksudku, kuda sungguhan?

1602
01:27:13.680 --> 01:27:15.770
Ya! Kuda sungguhan.

1603
01:27:17.930 --> 01:27:20.930
Hei, aku punya ide.

1604
01:27:30.970 --> 01:27:33.060
Lihat rok itu.

1605
01:27:43.310 --> 01:27:46.310
Tolong jaga anakku.

1606
01:27:50.810 --> 01:27:53.889
Teman-teman, kita berkumpul
di sini hari ini

1607
01:27:53.890 --> 01:27:57.219
untuk menyaksikan penyatuan paling indah

1608
01:27:57.220 --> 01:27:58.639
antara Sheriff Jessie

1609
01:27:58.640 --> 01:28:01.810
dan Buzz-tholomew MacLightyear.

1610
01:28:09.430 --> 01:28:10.719
Sekarang, Sheriff,

1611
01:28:10.720 --> 01:28:14.599
tolong pasangkan cincin ini
di jari mungil Buzz

1612
01:28:14.600 --> 01:28:16.890
dan ucapkan janji kalian.

1613
01:28:17.890 --> 01:28:20.469
Buzz, maukah kamu menerima cincin ini

1614
01:28:20.470 --> 01:28:22.179
sebagai janji kelingkingku

1615
01:28:22.180 --> 01:28:25.219
untuk bersenang-senang,
bermain bersamamu,

1616
01:28:25.220 --> 01:28:27.179
seumur hidupku,

1617
01:28:27.180 --> 01:28:29.219
