pembawa cincinnya?

1636
01:29:10.220 --> 01:29:11.889
- Oh.
- Awooga.

1637
01:29:11.890 --> 01:29:13.019
Oke.

1638
01:29:13.020 --> 01:29:14.700
Mereka datang.

1639
01:29:15.020 --> 01:29:16.469
Aku mengerti. Keren sekali.

1640
01:29:16.470 --> 01:29:17.929
Ide yang bagus.

1641
01:29:17.930 --> 01:29:19.809
Pernikahannya dimulai.

1642
01:29:19.810 --> 01:29:20.889
Oke!

1643
01:29:20.890 --> 01:29:22.309
- Buzz...
- Buzz,

1644
01:29:22.310 --> 01:29:25.349
apakah kamu mau menerimaku sebagai
istri Sheriff-mu yang keren?

1645
01:29:25.350 --> 01:29:28.219
Aku mau.
Dan apakah kamu mau menerimaku sebagai

1646
01:29:28.220 --> 01:29:30.929
suamimu, Space Ranger yang tampan?

1647
01:29:30.930 --> 01:29:33.120
Oh.

1648
01:29:33.270 --> 01:29:35.120
Aku mau.

1649
01:29:35.220 --> 01:29:37.349
Kalau begitu, dengan ini kalian...

1650
01:29:37.350 --> 01:29:39.269
Aku keberatan!

1651
01:29:39.270 --> 01:29:40.870
Oh, tidak.

1652
01:29:40.970 --> 01:29:43.059
Buzz sudah menikah...

1653
01:29:43.060 --> 01:29:44.700
denganku!

1654
01:29:47.770 --> 01:29:51.219
Ini sudah ketiga kalinya
aku mengalami hal seperti ini!

1655
01:29:51.220 --> 01:29:52.679
Tega sekali kamu!

1656
01:29:52.680 --> 01:29:53.719
Plak.

1657
01:29:53.720 --> 01:29:56.389
Jessie, bukan begitu maksudnya.

1658
01:29:56.390 --> 01:29:59.219
Katakan pada mereka, Buzz!
Ceritakan tentang cinta kita!

1659
01:29:59.220 --> 01:30:01.309
Tapi, Trixie, itu dulu...

1660
01:30:01.310 --> 01:30:04.450
dan sekarang sudah berbeda.

1661
01:30:04.520 --> 01:30:05.599
Lindungi bayi-bayi!

1662
01:30:05.600 --> 01:30:07.139
Kamu akan berurusan dengan pengacaraku!

1663
01:30:07.140 --> 01:30:08.809
- Ini keterlaluan.
- Katakan pada mereka, Buzz.

1664
01:30:08.810 --> 01:30:12.200
- Selamat.
- Kamu pasti bisa, Wakil.

1665
01:30:12.680 --> 01:30:14.349
- Jadi, kalian ikut membantu?
- Ya.

1666
01:30:14.350 --> 01:30:16.219
Kami hanya mengikuti arahan Jessie.

1667
01:30:16.220 --> 01:30:18.429
- Woody, maukah kamu...
- Um...

1668
01:30:18.430 --> 01:30:21.450
- pegang ini? Aku yang menyetir.
- Yah...

1669
01:30:21.890 --> 01:30:23.620
Ooh la la.

1670
01:30:27.020 --> 01:30:29.179
- Ya! Lihat mereka.
- Mereka bersinar.

1671
01:30:29.180 --> 01:30:30.639
Mereka berteman baik sekali.

1672
01:30:30.640 --> 01:30:31.969
Oke, simpan yang itu.

1673
01:30:31.970 --> 01:30:33.389
- Garang.
- Ya ampun. Ya!

1674
01:30:33.390 --> 01:30:34.429
Oke, Buzz pakai rok.

1675
01:30:34.430 --> 01:30:36.389
Aku mau pindah ke Palm Springs.

1676
01:30:36.390 --> 01:30:38.179
Bagaimana kalau Trixie
meracuni kue pernikahan?

1677
01:30:38.180 --> 01:30:42.269
Tapi, Trixie, kenapa?

1678
01:30:42.270 --> 01:30:44.639
Hei, kamu mau menginap di rumahku?

1679
01:30:44.640 --> 01:30:47.969
Mau! Pasti seru banget.

1680
01:30:47.970 --> 01:30:49.700
Lihat. Lihat, lihat.

1681
01:30:51.310 --> 01:30:53.519
<i>Teman selamanya, kawan.</i>

1682
01:30:53.520 --> 01:30:56.679
Ayo, Jessie.
Kita naik pesawat luar angkasaku.

1683
01:30:56.680 --> 01:30:58.719
-Mau ke mana dulu?
-Neptunus!

1684
01:30:58.720 --> 01:30:59.929
Kalian sedang apa?

1685
01:30:59.930 --> 01:31:01.429
Bulan madu!

1686
01:31:01.430 --> 01:31:02.519
Mau ikut?

1687
01:31:02.520 --> 01:31:05.099
-Tentu!
-Tunggu, tunggu.

1688
01:31:05.100 --> 01:31:06.599
Lihat, Jessie, lumba-lumba luar angkasa!

1689
01:31:06.600 --> 01:31:08.200
